The [[Shield of Valor]] is a legendary [[Shield]] available in the shop for all classes. Like most [[Shield]]s, it has a chance to block melee attacks, in which case it will prevent damage and drain stamina from the opponent. Compared to most [[Shield]]s derived from the common [[Wooden Buckler]], the [[Shield of Valor]] and its derivatives block more damage and drain more stamina. The [[Shield of Valor]] also causes adjacent items to give 30% more {{icon/block}}, making it great when next to [[Armor]] or other {{icon/block}} generating items.

All classes can combine the [[Shield of Valor]] with a [[Mana Orb]] to create the [[Moon Shield]], which has the added effect of gaining {{icon/mana}} the more {{icon/block}} is generated by the {{icon/star}} items.

There are also two class-specific [[Shield of Valor]] crafts.

The [[Sun Shield]] can be crafted by combining the [[Shield of Valor]] with two [[Flame]]s, which is a [[Pyromancer]] item. The [[Sun Shield]] trades in the {{icon/block}} gaining effect of the [[Shield of Valor]] for damage proportional to {{icon/star}} {{icon/block}} gained.

[[Adventurer]]s can combine the [[Shield of Valor]] with a [[Heart Container]] using [[Twine]] to make the very powerful [[Heart Shield]], which has {{icon/regeneration}}-granting effects and can eventually gain the ability to block even [[Ranged]] and [[Effect]] damage.
